{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t新疆精河縣發生4.2級地震，精河縣城、博樂市等地均有明顯震感，暫時沒有人員傷亡或房屋倒塌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n地震在昨晚11時40分發生，震源深度17公里，震央距離精河縣38公里、距離博樂市80公里。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n博州支隊精河縣大隊先遣隊10人已前往震央位置，博州支隊地震救援機動隊40人亦做好救援準備。消防部門將持續關注後續情況。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T19:40:33.518320+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T19:15:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T23:58:29.718127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T19:38:36.656628+00:00","content_hash":"8d210a4747fef808d75a7eae31f49e2154b56d6f1cc7098a1c0c1875189f1e00","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}